App "Clean Up in one tap" will help you:
- clean similar photos quickly and convenient way;
- preview and delete large videos;
- merge, remove, edit  duplicate contacts, duplicate phone numbers, duplicate emails, similar names, contacts without phone number;
- delete old calendar events;

You can also see how much memory is used on your device.

